=item SDL_EVENT_LOW_MEMORY = 258 - The application is low on memory, free memory if possible. This event must be handled in a callback set with SDL_AddEventWatch(). Called on iOS in applicationDidReceiveMemoryWarning() Called on Android in onTrimMemory()

=item SDL_EVENT_WILL_ENTER_BACKGROUND = 259 - The application is about to enter the background. This event must be handled in a callback set with SDL_AddEventWatch(). Called on iOS in applicationWillResignActive() Called on Android in onPause()

