=head2 SDL_EventAction

The type of action to request from SDL_PeepEvents().

=over

=item SDL_ADDEVENT = 0 - Add events to the back of the queue.

=item SDL_PEEKEVENT = 1 - Check but don't remove events from the queue front.

=item SDL_GETEVENT = 2 - Retrieve/remove events from the front of the queue.

=back



